OL,3,GNEWSAResidents want more tests over
OL,4,Atoxic chemical fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents concerned they could be at
OL,7,Felevated risk of serious health
OL,8,Fconditions from of a cancer-causing
OL,9,Fchemical are raising money to pay for
OL,10,Ffurther investigations.
OL,12,FBlood tests have found "really high
OL,13,Flevels" of a the substance, known as
OL,14,FPFOA, in dozens of people living near
OL,15,Fthe AGC Chemicals factory in
OL,16,FThornton-Cleveleys, Lancashire.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
