OL,3,GNEWSAResidents want more tests over
OL,4,Atoxic chemical fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe residents group said money raised
OL,7,Fby a crowdfunding campaign will help
OL,8,Ffund additional blood testing, expert
OL,9,Fanalysis of residents' results and
OL,10,Ffurther studies of local soil, water
OL,11,Fand air.
OL,13,FThey say they are acting as official
OL,14,Fefforts to address concerns have "been
OL,15,Fslow" and "too little action has been
OL,16,Ftaken".
